law.text:
		For the purposes of venue, any violation of this chapter shall be considered to have been committed in any county or city:

In which any act was performed in furtherance of any course of conduct that violates this chapter;


That is the principal place of the enterprise in the Commonwealth;


In which any offender had control or possession of any proceeds of a violation of this chapter, or of any records, or any other material or objects, which were used in furtherance of a violation;


In which any offender resides; or


Any place of venue under Article 2 (§ 19.2-244 et seq.) of Chapter 15 of Title 19.2.
